D3. Consolidate Duplicate Conditional Fragments
Problem:
The same fragment of code is in all branches of a conditional expression.
Solution:
Move it outside of the expression.
// Before
if (isSpecialDeal()) {
total = price * 0.95;
send();
} else {
total = price * 0.98;
send();
}
// After
if (isSpecialDeal()) {
total = price * 0.95;
} else {
total = price * 0.98;
}
send();
